'''Calamary''' (よっちゃん, '''''Yotchan''''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3, [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 4.5 Update|Version 4.5]].

